<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00601">
	<title>Turning OFF Smart Cruise Control</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03779">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03780">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i25_B10_033_1_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Press the Driving Assist button to turn Smart Cruise Control <term translate="no">OFF</term>.</p>
		<note type="note">
			<p>If your vehicle is equipped with Manual Speed Limit Assist, press and hold the Driving Assist button to turn <term translate="no">OFF</term> Smart Cruise Control. However, this action turns <term translate="no">ON</term> Manual Speed Limit Assist.</p>
		</note>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Do not use the switches and buttons at the same time. Smart Cruise Control may not operate properly.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00595.dita#t00595" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Turning on Smart Cruise Control</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>